{"id":"69fbb4b15888982f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code.md","title":"Polish Metric Presentation","display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code — Polish Metric Presentation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code — Polish Metric Presentation","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive2-polish-space-code — Polish Metric Presentation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d,\\mathcal D\\in V\">\\(X,d,\\mathcal D\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span> is the metric-space predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\n\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq X\n\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathcal D\\;(d(x,q)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in X^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\land N\\leq n\\to d(s(m),s(n))&lt;\\varepsilon)]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to d(s(n),x)&lt;\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\n\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq X\n\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathcal D\\;(d(x,q)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in X^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\land N\\leq n\\to d(s(m),s(n))&lt;\\varepsilon)]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to d(s(n),x)&lt;\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Density and metric completeness are expanded with the same metric <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>; the former calls to unrelated predicates have been removed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S$ is the metric-space predicate from [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。 $\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega$，见 [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。 $\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega$，见 [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d,\\mathcal D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2PolishSpaceCode}_S(X,d,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\n\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq X\n\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathcal D\\;(d(x,q)<\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in X^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\land N\\leq n\\to d(s(m),s(n))<\\varepsilon)]\\\\\n&\\hspace{42mm}\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to d(s(n),x)<\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":false}],"bytes":1954,"backlinks":[{"id":"6b5d81e801f2a0b2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\math